[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2508714131","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99853#issuecomment-2508714131","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99853","id":2508714131,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Vh_CT","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-29T22:38:49Z","updated_at":"2024-11-29T22:40:42Z","body":"I think I changed TextEdit's behavior since VSCode copies text when cutting and not editable, though it also shows a notification that it is not editable.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/576622bc-c933-4be4-9a19-67b912a13950)\n\nI'm fine with changing the TextEdit (and CodeEdit) behavior to not copy on cut when not editable.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2508714131/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2508716671","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99853#issuecomment-2508716671","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99853","id":2508716671,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Vh_p_","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-29T22:45:36Z","updated_at":"2024-11-29T22:46:55Z","body":"Firefox 133 will copy text on <kbd>Ctrl + X</kbd>, but Chromium 131 won't:\n\n```html\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width\">\n  <title>JS Bin</title>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <input readonly value=\"Triple-click to select me\">\n</body>\n</html>\n```\n\nPaste the above HTML in [JSBin](https://jsbin.com/) to test it.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2508716671/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2508977969","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99853#issuecomment-2508977969","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99853","id":2508977969,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Vi_cx","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-30T14:24:48Z","updated_at":"2024-11-30T14:24:48Z","body":"I argued this over with a friend and it oddly turned into a philosophical question.\n\nIt basically boiled down to two countering points:\n- The Cut shortcut **should not** work, because a read-only text field is essentially a paragraph (like in web browsers).\n- The Cut shortcut **should**  work, because a read-only text field may be writeable, most of the times. Hence, if it doesn't, that behavior is unexpected (like in code editors).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2508977969/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]